{"seq":2,"slug":"catch-weight-variable-weight","title":"按重量计价/可变重量(catch-weight)商品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-pricing-inventory/catch-weight-variable-weight","wordCount":2232,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"按重量计价-可变重量-catch-weight-商品\">按重量计价/可变重量(catch-weight)商品</h1><p>上一节所有推论的隐含前提是&quot;净含量是常数&quot;：一包 454 克，每包都一样。生鲜、散装食品、化工原料、部分金属件不满足这个前提——它们的净含量由出库时的一次称重决定，同一条码下的两件商品重量可能相差 15%。这类商品在零售与供应链里叫可变重量商品（variable measure item），业内也常称按重量计价或 catch-weight。</p>\n<p>它给系统带来的不是&quot;多一个字段&quot;，而是三个时点上的重新安排：<strong>价格何时锁定、库存何时扣减、金额何时确定</strong>。在固定净含量商品上这三件事可以同时发生，在这里必须分开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可变重量商品的核心是把&quot;净含量&quot;这一属性<strong>从主数据搬到交易数据</strong>。主数据里的 GTIN 从此只描述品类（&quot;五花肉，按千克计价&quot;），而每一件的实际净重是它自己的属性，随称重产生、随出库冻结。这个搬迁带来一条连锁反应：凡是依赖&quot;净含量是常量&quot;推出的结论都失效——下单金额不再确定、库存扣减时点后移、对账需要区分声明重量与实际重量。</p>\n<p>判断一个商品是否属于这一类，只需要问：<strong>同一 GTIN 的两件商品，净含量是否可能不同</strong>。若可能，则它必须走这条路径；若不可能（如预包装饮料），把它当成可变重量处理只会引入不必要的复杂度和对账困难。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可变重量商品的标识\">可变重量商品的标识</h2><h3 id=\"没有固定-gtin-的变通\">没有固定 GTIN 的变通</h3><p>一个 GTIN 对应一个固定的贸易项，但可变重量商品每件都不同，理论上每件都该有自己的标识。GS1 的做法是：为同一类可变重量商品分配一个<strong>共用 GTIN</strong>，真实重量与金额通过应用标识符（AI）承载在条码里——价格嵌入型条码把金额直接编进条码，重量嵌入型则编入净重由收银系统计算金额。</p>\n<p>这条变通的意义可以对照 GTIN 的一般规则来理解：GTIN-14 的最高位是指示位，用于区分同一商品的<strong>不同包装配置</strong>，而每件商品的净含量正是它的一个属性（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_Trade_Item_Number\">GTIN</a>）。可变重量把这个属性从&quot;按配置固定&quot;变成了&quot;按件浮动&quot;，因此必须外移到交易数据。</p>\n<p>工程上的关键结论是：<strong>主数据里的 GTIN 描述的是&quot;这类商品&quot;，而每一件实例的净重存在交易数据里</strong>。这和固定净含量商品把净含量放在主数据里是相反的。若沿用固定净含量的建模（净含量挂 GTIN），就会出现&quot;同一 GTIN 的两次称重必须写同一个值&quot;的荒谬约束。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>商品类型</th>\n<th>净含量存放位置</th>\n<th>GTIN 语义</th>\n<th>价格锁定时机</th>\n<th>库存扣减时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定净含量</td>\n<td>主数据（trade_item）</td>\n<td>具体规格</td>\n<td>下单时</td>\n<td>下单时（预占）/ 出库时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可变重量</td>\n<td>交易数据（每件）</td>\n<td>品类占位</td>\n<td>出库称重后</td>\n<td>出库称重时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>称重后包装</td>\n<td>交易数据</td>\n<td>品类占位</td>\n<td>标签打印时</td>\n<td>出库时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三个时点的重新安排\">三个时点的重新安排</h2><h3 id=\"价格-从下单锁定改为出库锁定\">价格：从下单锁定改为出库锁定</h3><p>固定净含量商品下单时金额就确定了。可变重量商品下单时只能给出<strong>预估金额</strong>（下单重量 × 单价），实际金额在出库称重后才确定。这对支付流程的影响是实质性的：预授权金额是预估的，最终扣款是实际称重的，二者必须能对账。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant C as 客户&#10;  participant O as 订单服务&#10;  participant W as 仓库/称重&#10;  participant P as 支付&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;O: 下单 1.0 kg 五花肉(预估)&#10;  O-&gt;&gt;P: 预授权 预估金额 x 1.1&#10;  O-&gt;&gt;W: 出库任务 目标 1.0 kg&#10;  W-&gt;&gt;W: 实际称重 0.92 kg&#10;  W-&gt;&gt;O: 回传实际净重 + 封装&#10;  O-&gt;&gt;O: 实付 = 0.92 x 单价(取整)&#10;  O-&gt;&gt;P: 按实付金额请款&#10;  P-&gt;&gt;C: 扣款 实付金额&#10;  O-&gt;&gt;C: 通知 调整后金额\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant C as 客户\n  participant O as 订单服务\n  participant W as 仓库/称重\n  participant P as 支付\n  C-&gt;&gt;O: 下单 1.0 kg 五花肉(预估)\n  O-&gt;&gt;P: 预授权 预估金额 x 1.1\n  O-&gt;&gt;W: 出库任务 目标 1.0 kg\n  W-&gt;&gt;W: 实际称重 0.92 kg\n  W-&gt;&gt;O: 回传实际净重 + 封装\n  O-&gt;&gt;O: 实付 = 0.92 x 单价(取整)\n  O-&gt;&gt;P: 按实付金额请款\n  P-&gt;&gt;C: 扣款 实付金额\n  O-&gt;&gt;C: 通知 调整后金额</pre><p>预授权通常带一个上浮系数（如 1.1），因为实际重量可能高于下单量。若完全按预估金额授权，实际超重时会出现授权不足导致支付失败。</p>\n<h3 id=\"库存-以称重结果为准的数量变动\">库存：以称重结果为准的数量变动</h3><p>可变重量商品的库存记账单位仍是基本单位（千克），但入库与出库的数量来自称重，而不是来自包装计数。这意味着库存的<strong>理论值</strong>（供应商声称的重量）与<strong>实际值</strong>（我方称重）之间会天然存在差异，这条差异必须在收货时就处理掉，否则会一路带到盘点。</p>\n<p>实践中这条差额有明确的会计处理：超出容差的部分记为<strong>收货差异</strong>并要求供应商确认，容差内的部分计入自然损耗。把差额默认吞掉，会让库存精度慢性恶化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"金额-单价取自挂牌价-数量取自称重\">金额：单价取自挂牌价，数量取自称重</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>line</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>round</mtext><mtext>HALF_UP</mtext></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>weighed_kg</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>list</mtext></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>list_base</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{line}} = \\text{round}_{\\text{HALF\\_UP}}\\left(q_{\\text{weighed\\_kg}} \\times \\frac{P_{\\text{list}}}{q_{\\text{list\\_base}}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">line</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.503em;vertical-align:-1.053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">HALF_UP</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">weighed_kg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">list_base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">list</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意单价的归一化仍遵循 <a href=\"unit-price-per-kg-l-oz\">每单位/每升/每百克价折算与展示</a> 的口径，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的来源不同。这条复用是刻意的：<strong>如果可变重量商品走另一套定价代码，两套代码的取整规则必然分叉</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据模型\">数据模型</h2><h3 id=\"实例级称重记录\">实例级称重记录</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE weighed_instance (&#10;  instance_id     text PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  gtin            text NOT NULL REFERENCES trade_item(gtin),&#10;  sku_id          text NOT NULL,&#10;  lot_no          text,&#10;  tare_kg         numeric(12,6) NOT NULL,          -- 皮重(容器/包装)&#10;  gross_kg        numeric(12,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  net_kg          numeric(12,6) GENERATED ALWAYS AS (gross_kg - tare_kg) STORED,&#10;  scale_id        text NOT NULL,&#10;  weighed_at      timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  weighed_by     text NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_net_positive CHECK (gross_kg &gt; tare_kg),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_tare CHECK (tare_kg &gt;= 0)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE weighed_instance_ref (&#10;  instance_id   text PRIMARY KEY REFERENCES weighed_instance(instance_id),&#10;  order_id      text,&#10;  order_line_id text,&#10;  shipment_id   text,&#10;  frozen_price_per_base numeric(18,8),   -- 出库时冻结的归一化单价&#10;  frozen_currency text,&#10;  line_amount   numeric(18,2)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> weighed_instance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instance_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gtin            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trade_item(gtin),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lot_no          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tare_kg         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 皮重(容器/包装)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gross_kg        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  net_kg          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (gross_kg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tare_kg) STORED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scale_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  weighed_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  weighed_by     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_net_positive </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (gross_kg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tare_kg),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_tare </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tare_kg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> weighed_instance_ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instance_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weighed_instance(instance_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_line_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipment_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  frozen_price_per_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 出库时冻结的归一化单价</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  frozen_currency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  line_amount   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>net_kg</code> 用生成列表达，确保皮重与毛重的修改自动反映到净重，避免&quot;改了毛重忘了改净重&quot;这类不一致。<code>frozen_price_per_base</code> 是刻意的：单价在出库时冻结，之后调价不影响已发出的货。</p>\n<h3 id=\"秤与计量器具的合规\">秤与计量器具的合规</h3><p>称重结果的法律效力依附于计量器具。用于贸易结算的衡器受<strong>法定计量</strong>制度约束：须经检定合格、在有效期内，且精度等级要匹配被称量商品的最小分度值。这一点在小包裹场景特别容易被忽略——用精度 50 g 的地磅去称 200 g 的商品，误差率高达 25%。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>商品量级</th>\n<th>建议分度值</th>\n<th>允许误差量级</th>\n<th>器具要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 1 kg</td>\n<td>1 g</td>\n<td>千分之几</td>\n<td>计价秤，须检定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1–50 kg</td>\n<td>10–50 g</td>\n<td>千分之几</td>\n<td>台秤，须检定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50 kg–2 t</td>\n<td>0.2–1 kg</td>\n<td>千分之几</td>\n<td>地磅，须检定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 2 t</td>\n<td>1–20 kg</td>\n<td>千分之几</td>\n<td>汽车衡，须检定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中&quot;允许误差量级&quot;刻意写得笼统：具体数值由各国的法定计量规程与器具精度等级决定，系统不该把它硬编码成一个常数，而应作为<strong>器具主数据</strong>的一部分记录（器具编号、检定有效期、分度值），在称重时校验器具状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账与残差\">对账与残差</h2><h3 id=\"三类差异\">三类差异</h3><p>可变重量商品的对账要区分三类差异，混在一起就无法归因。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  w.gtin, w.lot_no,&#10;  COUNT(*)                                   AS instances,&#10;  SUM(w.net_kg)                              AS total_weighed_kg,&#10;  SUM(COALESCE(oi.declared_kg, 0))           AS total_declared_kg,&#10;  SUM(w.net_kg - COALESCE(oi.declared_kg,0)) AS variance_kg,&#10;  SUM(r.line_amount)                         AS total_amount&#10;FROM weighed_instance w&#10;LEFT JOIN supplier_declared oi ON oi.instance_id = w.instance_id&#10;LEFT JOIN weighed_instance_ref r ON r.instance_id = w.instance_id&#10;WHERE w.weighed_at &gt;= date_trunc(&#39;month&#39;, now())&#10;GROUP BY w.gtin, w.lot_no&#10;HAVING ABS(SUM(w.net_kg - COALESCE(oi.declared_kg,0))) &gt; 0.05 * SUM(w.net_kg);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lot_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instances,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">net_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_weighed_kg,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">oi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_declared_kg,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">net_kg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">oi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> variance_kg,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weighed_instance w</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_declared oi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> oi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">instance_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">instance_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weighed_instance_ref r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">instance_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">instance_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">weighed_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lot_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">net_kg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">oi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">05</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">net_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>HAVING</code> 里 5% 的阈值是分品类可调的：散装生鲜的自然失水在 1–2% 属于正常，化工原料几乎不应有差异。把它做成全局常数会导致要么天天告警、要么永远发现不了问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与盘点-报关的衔接\">与盘点、报关的衔接</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>盘点</strong>：可变重量商品的账面数量是称重累积值，盘点同样以称重为准，其差异归因流程见 <a href=\"base-unit-inventory-multiuom\">基准单位库存与多单位库存</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>报关</strong>：法定计量单位通常正是千克，因此可变重量商品在报关侧反而比固定净含量商品更直接——但需要注意<strong>申报重量应是净重而非毛重</strong>，皮重必须扣除。</li>\n<li><strong>发票</strong>：多件商品的发票行可以按订单汇总，但底层明细必须保留每一件的称重记录，否则争议时无法举证。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"常见错误\">常见错误</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>把称重结果写回主数据</strong>：导致同一 GTIN 的第二件商品覆盖第一件的重量。</li>\n<li><strong>下单即扣减库存</strong>：实际出库重量可能与下单量不同，账面会持续偏移。</li>\n<li><strong>用同一容差处理所有品类</strong>：生鲜与化工的合理差异量级差一个数量级。</li>\n<li><strong>忽略器具检定状态</strong>：贸易结算用未经检定的秤，在法律上处于不利地位。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可变重量商品的 GTIN 标识&quot;品类&quot;而非&quot;规格&quot;，每件实例的净重存在交易数据里。</li>\n<li>三个时点被重新安排：价格在出库称重后锁定、库存在称重时变动、金额在称重后确定；下单时只有预估。</li>\n<li>底层的称重记录必须逐件保留；归一化单价在出库时冻结，之后调价不影响已发货。</li>\n<li>收货差异需在收货环节处理完毕，容差按品类设定；称重器具的检定状态是主数据而非备注。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>称重结果最终要落到库存账上，而账面只接受一个单位——这条归一的规则见 <a href=\"base-unit-inventory-multiuom\">基准单位库存与多单位库存</a>；单价归一化与单位价格展示的口径来自 <a href=\"unit-price-per-kg-l-oz\">每单位/每升/每百克价折算与展示</a>。</p>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"base-unit-inventory-multiuom\">基准单位库存与多单位库存</a> 处理库存账面为什么必须落在唯一一个基准单位上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按重量计价/可变重量(catch-weight)商品","id":"按重量计价-可变重量-catch-weight-商品"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可变重量商品的标识","id":"可变重量商品的标识"},{"level":3,"text":"没有固定 GTIN 的变通","id":"没有固定-gtin-的变通"},{"level":2,"text":"三个时点的重新安排","id":"三个时点的重新安排"},{"level":3,"text":"价格：从下单锁定改为出库锁定","id":"价格-从下单锁定改为出库锁定"},{"level":3,"text":"库存：以称重结果为准的数量变动","id":"库存-以称重结果为准的数量变动"},{"level":3,"text":"金额：单价取自挂牌价，数量取自称重","id":"金额-单价取自挂牌价-数量取自称重"},{"level":2,"text":"数据模型","id":"数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"实例级称重记录","id":"实例级称重记录"},{"level":3,"text":"秤与计量器具的合规","id":"秤与计量器具的合规"},{"level":2,"text":"对账与残差","id":"对账与残差"},{"level":3,"text":"三类差异","id":"三类差异"},{"level":3,"text":"与盘点、报关的衔接","id":"与盘点-报关的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"常见错误","id":"常见错误"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"每单位/每升/每百克价折算与展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-pricing-inventory/unit-price-per-kg-l-oz"},"next":{"title":"基准单位库存与多单位库存（联034）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-pricing-inventory/base-unit-inventory-multiuom"}}